sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Utente
  participant R as Express Router
  participant V as validate (Zod)
  participant H as HistoryService
  participant F as historyExporters (Strategy)
  participant DB as Sequelize / SQLite
  U->>R: GET /api/games/{id}/history?format=pdf&period=7d
  R->>V: valida id e query (format, from/to oppure period)
  V-->>R: filtro tipizzato
  R->>H: export(id, userId, filtro, response)
  H->>DB: carica partita (solo i partecipanti) e mosse
  H->>H: numera le mosse e applica l'intervallo di date
  H->>F: historyExporters[format].send(report)
  alt format = json
    F-->>U: 200 application/json
  else format = pdf
    F-->>U: 200 application/pdf (PDFKit)
  end
